                            <comment id="16456356" author="ilyak" created="Fri, 27 Apr 2018 13:02:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;IMO InetSocketAddress.getAddress()  should always be null-checked, via IgniteUtils method for example.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16479078" author="ilyak" created="Thu, 17 May 2018 13:49:38 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;It turns out there&apos;s some checks which prevents this issue to be much more visible, in TcpDiscoverySpi.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Still, it&apos;s possible to get IPv6 addresses for Communication from other nodes even if they Discovery by IPv4.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
